                                    'creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14)\n'
                                    'from one of two chains, and it has the Restrained con-\n'
                                    'dition until the grapple ends.\n'
                                    'Conjure Infernal Chain. The devil conjures a fiery\n'
                                    'chain to bind a creature. Dexterity Saving Throw:\n'
                                    'DC 15, one creature the devil can see within 60 feet.\n'
                                    'Failure: 9 (2d4 + 4) Fire damage, and the target has\n'
                                    'the Restrained condition until the end of the devil’s\n'
                                    'next turn, at which point the chain disappears. If the\n'
                                    'target is Large or smaller, the devil moves the target\n'
                                    'up to 30 feet straight toward itself. Success: The chain\n'
                                    'disappears.\n'
                                    'Reactions\n'
                                    'Unnerving Gaze. Trigger: A creature the devil can\n'
                                    'see starts its turn within 30 feet of the devil and can\n'
