                           'Resistances Bludgeoning, Piercing, Slashing\n'
                           'Immunities Necrotic, Poison; Charmed, Exhaustion,\n'
                           'Frightened, Grappled, Incapacitated, Paralyzed,\n'
                           'Petrified, Poisoned, Prone, Restrained, Stunned\n'
                           'Senses Blindsight 30 ft.; Passive Perception 10\n'
                           'Languages Understands Common but can’t speak\n'
                           'CR 3 (XP 700; PB +2)\n'
                           'Traits\n'
                           'Swarm. The swarm can occupy another creature’s\n'
