                         'ture and the darkmantle had Advantage on the attack\n'
                         'roll, it covers the target, which has the Blinded condi-\n'
                         'tion and is suffocating while the darkmantle is attached\n'
                         'in this way.\n'
                         'While attached to a target, the darkmantle can attack\n'
                         'only the target but has Advantage on its attack rolls. Its\n'
                         'Speed becomes 0, it can’t benefit from any bonus to its\n'
                         'Speed, and it moves with the target.\n'
                         'A creature can take an action to try to detach the\n'
                         'darkmantle from itself, doing so with a successful DC\n'
                         '13 Strength (Athletics) check. On its turn, the darkman-\n'
                         'tle can detach itself by using 5 feet of movement.\n'
