                              'CR 10 (XP 5,900; PB +4)\n'
                              'Traits\n'
                              'Exalted Restoration. If the deva dies outside Mount\n'
                              'Celestia, its body disappears, and it gains a new body\n'
                              'instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in\n'
