                              'Djinni\n'
                              'Large Elemental (Genie), Neutral\n'
                              'AC 17 \t\t Initiative +2 (12)\n'
                              'HP 218 (19d10 + 114)\n'
                              'Speed 30 ft., Fly 90 ft. (hover)\n'
                              'MOD SAVE MOD SAVE MOD SAVE\n'
                              'Str 21 +5 +5 Dex 15 +2 +6 Con 22 +6 +6\n'
                              'Int 15 +2 +2 Wis 16 +3 +7 Cha 20 +5 +5\n'
                              'Immunities Lightning, Thunder\n'
                              'Senses Darkvision 120 ft.; Passive Perception 13\n'
                              'Languages Primordial (Auran)\n'
                              'CR 11 (XP 7,200; PB +4)\n'
                              'Traits\n'
                              'Elemental Restoration. If the djinni dies outside the\n'
                              'Elemental Plane of Air, its body dissolves into mist, and\n'
                              'it gains a new body in 1d4 days, reviving with all its Hit\n'
                              'Points somewhere on the Plane of Air.\n'
                              'Magic Resistance. The djinni has Advantage on saving\n'
                              'throws against spells and other magical effects.\n'
                              'Wishes. The djinni has a 30 percent chance of knowing\n'
                              'the Wish spell. If the djinni knows it, the djinni can cast\n'
                              'it only on behalf of a non-genie creature who commu-\n'
                              'nicates a wish in a way the djinni can understand. If the\n'
                              'djinni casts the spell for the creature, the djinni suffers\n'
                              'none of the spell’s stress. Once the djinni has cast it\n'
                              'three times, the djinni can’t do so again for 365 days.\n'
                              'Actions\n'
                              'Multiattack. The djinni makes three attacks, using\n'
                              'Storm Blade or Storm Bolt in any combination.\n'
                              'Storm Blade. Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 feet.\n'
                              'Hit: 12 (2d6 + 5) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Light-\n'
                              'ning damage.\n'
                              'Storm Bolt. Ranged Attack Roll: +9, range 120 feet.\n'
                              'Hit: 13 (3d8) Thunder damage. If the target is a Large or\n'
                              'smaller creature, it has the Prone condition.\n'
                              'Create Whirlwind. The djinni conjures a whirlwind at\n'
                              'a point it can see within 120 feet. The whirlwind fills a\n'
                              '20-foot-radius, 60-foot-high Cylinder centered on that\n'
                              'point. The whirlwind lasts until the djinni’s Concentra-\n'
                              'tion on it ends. The djinni can move the whirlwind up\n'
                              'to 20 feet at the start of each of its turns.\n'
                              'Whenever the whirlwind enters a creature’s space or\n'
                              'a creature enters the whirlwind, that creature is sub-\n'
                              'jected to the following effect. Strength Saving Throw:\n'
                              'DC 17 (a creature makes this save only once per turn,\n'
                              'and the djinni is unaffected). Failure: While in the\n'
                              'whirlwind, the target has the Restrained condition\n'
                              'and moves with the whirlwind. At the start of each of\n'
                              'its turns, the Restrained target takes 21 (6d6) Thunder\n'
                              'damage. At the end of each of its turns, the target re-\n'
                              'peats the save, ending the effect on itself on a success.\n'
                              'Spellcasting. The djinni casts one of the following\n'
                              'spells, requiring no Material components and using\n'
                              'Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17):\n'
                              'At Will: Detect Evil and Good, Detect Magic\n'
                              '2/Day Each: Create Food and Water (can create wine\n'
                              'instead of water), Tongues, Wind Walk\n'
                              '1/Day Each: Creation, Gaseous Form, Invisibility, Major\n'
                              'Image, Plane Shift\n'
