                          'Frightened, Paralyzed, Poisoned\n'
                          'Senses Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 11\n'
                          'Languages Common plus two other languages\n'
                          'CR 3 (XP 700; PB +2)\n'
                          'Actions\n'
                          'Multiattack. The mummy makes two Rotting Fist at-\n'
                          'tacks and uses Dreadful Glare.\n'
                          'Rotting Fist. Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8\n'
                          '(1d10 + 3) Bludgeoning damage plus 10 (3d6) Necrotic\n'
                          'damage. If the target is a creature, it is cursed. While\n'
                          'cursed, the target can’t regain Hit Points, its Hit Point\n'
                          'maximum doesn’t return to normal when finishing a\n'
