                          '(3d6) every 24 hours that elapse. A creature dies and\n'
                          'turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points by this attack.\n'
                          'Dreadful Glare. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 11, one\n'
                          'creature the mummy can see within 60 feet. Failure:\n'
                          'The target has the Frightened condition until the end of\n'
                          'the mummy’s next turn. Success: The target is immune\n'
                          'to this mummy’s Dreadful Glare for 24 hours.\n'
                          'Mummy Lord\n'
                          'Medium or Small Undead (Cleric), Lawful Evil\n'
                          'AC 17\t\t Initiative +10 (20)\n'
                          'HP 187 (25d8 + 75)\n'
                          'Speed 30 ft.\n'
                          'MOD SAVE MOD SAVE MOD SAVE\n'
                          'Str 18 +4 +4 Dex 10 +0 +0 Con 17 +3 +3\n'
                          'Int 11 +0 +5 Wis 19 +4 +9 Cha 16 +3 +3\n'
                          'Skills History +5, Perception +9, Religion +5\n'
