                      'it can see within 5 feet of its destination space has\n'
                      'the Blinded condition until the end of the mummy’s\n'
                      'next turn.\n'
                      'Pursuit. Trigger: Another creature the nalfeshnee can\n'
                      'see ends its move within 120 feet of the nalfeshnee.\n'
