                                 'by a creature within 5 feet of itself. Dexterity Saving\n'
                                 'Throw: DC 11, the creature with the object. Failure:\n'
                                 'The object takes a −1 penalty to the AC it offers (ar-\n'
                                 'mor) or to its attack rolls (weapon). Armor is destroyed\n'
