                              'can grapple one Large creature or up to two Medium\n'
                              'or smaller creatures at a time with Whelm. As an ac-\n'
                              'tion, a creature within 5 feet of the elemental can pull\n'
                              'a creature out of it by succeeding on a DC 14 Strength\n'
                              '(Athletics) check. Success: Half damage only.\n'
