                                        'expended uses at the start of each of its turns.\n'
                                        'Freezing Burst. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 14,\n'
                                        'each creature in a 30-foot-radius Sphere centered on\n'
                                        'a point the dragon can see within 120 feet. Failure: 7\n'
                                        '(2d6) Cold damage, and the target’s Speed is 0 until\n'
                                        'the end of the target’s next turn. Failure or Success: The\n'
                                        'dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its\n'
                                        'next turn.\n'
