                               'and its High Jump is up to 10 feet with or without a\n'
                               'running start.\n'
                               'Actions\n'
                               'Bite. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2)\n'
                               'Piercing damage plus 5 (2d4) Poison damage. If the tar-\n'
                               'get is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Grappled\n'
                               'condition (escape DC 12).\n'
                               'Swallow. The toad swallows a Medium or smaller target\n'
                               'it is grappling. While swallowed, the target isn’t Grap-\n'
                               'pled but has the Blinded and Restrained conditions,\n'
                               'and it has Total Cover against attacks and other effects\n'
                               'outside the toad. In addition, the target takes 10 (3d6)\n'
                               'Acid damage at the end of each of the toad’s turns. The\n'
                               'toad can have only one target swallowed at a time, and\n'
                               'it can’t use Bite while it has a swallowed target. If the\n'
                               'toad dies, a swallowed creature is no longer Restrained\n'
                               'and can escape from the corpse using 5 feet of move-\n'
